Cognate with {{cog|grc|ὅτε}}.

The spelling {{m|gmy|𐀃𐀳}} appears to demonstrate that the suffix ''-te'' in this context is distinct from the enclitic conjunction {{m|gmy|𐀤|-𐀤|ts=-kʷe}}, from {{der|gmy|ine-pro|*-kʷe}}, which later also yielded Ancient Greek {{m|grc|τε}}.

