𐀠𐀪𐀋𐀳:
===Etymology===
From {{m|gmy|*𐀠𐀪𐀁𐀳|ts=prihentēr}}, with an apparent loss of intervocalic {{IPAchar|/h/}}.

===Noun===
{{head|gmy|noun|g=m|ts=prientēr}} {{qinfl|gmy|nom|sg}} {{tlb|gmy|Knossos}} 

# {{alt form|gmy|*𐀠𐀪𐀁𐀳|ts=prihentēr}}

====Usage notes====
The singular ''pi-ri-je-te'' is directly attested at [[Knossos]], while the plural ''pi-ri-je-te-re'' is also attested at [[Pylos]] alongside ''pi-ri-e-te-re''. The spelling with ''-je-'' in Knossos is generally interpreted as reflecting the loss of intervocalic {{IPAchar|/h/}} preserved in the attested forms of ''*pi-ri-e-te'' {{IPAchar|/prihentēr/}}. It appears that Pylos was also undergoing this process.

