Compare Thessalian {{m|grc|Νέσσανδρος}}, which continues the same name with {{m|grc|ἀνδρο-|-ανδρος}}, and {{m|grc|Νέστωρ}}, interpreted by García Ramón and others as a potential shortened/hypocoristic form of this name.

===Proper noun===
{{head|gmy|proper noun|g=m|ts=Nestiānōr}}<ref>{{R|gmy|MGV|p=173}}</ref><ref>{{R|gmy|Documents2|p=563}}</ref> {{qinfl|gmy|nom|sg}}

